usage: - [-h] [--depths DEPTHS] [--off NAME=false|0] --output OUTPUT
         [--timeout TIMEOUT]
         base candidate

Compare fresh-process OFF bench nodes with an exact base; keep raw evidence.

positional arguments:
  base
  candidate

options:
  -h, --help          show this help message and exit
  --depths DEPTHS
  --off NAME=false|0  Explicit candidate-only OFF setting; all other options
                      keep fresh-process defaults.
  --output OUTPUT     New evidence directory; never overwritten.
  --timeout TIMEOUT   Seconds per process.
